---
layout: page
title: Architecture decision records
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
description: Significant technical decisions for the Private Landlord workstream, and why they were made.
---
<p class="govuk-body">Each record describes one decision: the context, the options considered and the outcome. Records are never deleted. A decision that changes gets a new record that supersedes the old one.</p>
{% set adrs = collections.adr %}{# Eleventy sorts by date, then by file name #}
<table class="govuk-table"><thead class="govuk-table__head"><tr class="govuk-table__row">
<th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Number</th><th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Decision</th>
<th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Status</th><th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Date</th></tr></thead>
<tbody class="govuk-table__body">
{% for a in adrs %}<tr class="govuk-table__row">
<td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ a.page.fileSlug.slice(0, 4) }}</td>
<td class="govuk-table__cell"><a class="govuk-link" href="{{ a.url }}">{{ a.data.title }}</a></td>
<td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ a.data.status | capitalize | statusTag("done" if a.data.status == "accepted" else ("indeterminate" if a.data.status == "proposed" else "new")) }}</td>
<td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ a.data.date | date }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
<p class="govuk-body-s">To add a record, copy <code>src/adr/template.md.txt</code> to the next number and open a pull request.</p>
